The writing
-----------
The MIT grant above covers the code. It does not cover the editorial content:
the entry descriptions, the continuity groupings, the tier and era judgements,
and the interface copy. Those are the work of this project and are not
licensed for reuse. Facts are not copyrightable and nobody owns them: titles,
years, episode counts and running times are free for anyone to use.

